    "flawed_loop_in_dumpFlowBasedFeatures": {
      "method": "dumpFlowBasedFeatures()",
      "lines": "Lines 669-671",
      "code": "for(String key: flagCounts.keySet()){\n    dump+=flagCounts.get(key).value+\",\";\n}",
      "mechanism": "java.util.HashMap.keySet() iterates in hash-bucket order, not insertion order. Bucket index = (h ^ (h >>> 16)) & 15. This placed PSH into column 52 (labeled RST Flag Count) in the original CIC-DDoS2019 dataset."
    },
